<ontology/use_calico_printing/use_calico_printing__0141__q2/#resource> dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Watt (1908), Commercial Products of India, scan p. 795" ;
    dcterms:source <https://archive.org/details/b31361584/page/n795/mode/1up> ;
    a <ontology/EvidenceQuote/#resource> ;
    rdfs:label "Evidence for Cotton Raw used in Calico Cloth & Calico Printing: Watt (1908), Commercial Products of India, scan p. 795"@en ;
    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "In dyeing cotton yarn or cloth, certain ingredients that act as mordants or acids to brighten the colour are used along with the morinda extract, or other dyes are employed along with it, to produce brilliant reds."@en ;
